                        or :math:`(N, C, D_\text{in}, H_\text{in}, W_\text{in})` (5-D case)
        grid (Tensor): flow-field of shape :math:`(N, H_\text{out}, W_\text{out}, 2)` (4-D case)
                       or :math:`(N, D_\text{out}, H_\text{out}, W_\text{out}, 3)` (5-D case)
